core sections: Squeezebox (thicker more powerful sections combined with thinner more flexible sections profiled throughout core for enhanced energy transfer)
base: Sintered WFO (extra absorbent, high density sintered material infused with specially formulated wax)
break-in technology: Infinite Ride (boards overbuilt in factory then broken down using machinery so ride is consistent from day one to day 100)
tip/tail design: Pro-Tip (tip and tail taper out at the points, reducing swing weight and promoting mobility)
resin: Super Sap Epoxy (bio-based resin, reduces carbon footprint by 50% over conventional petroleum-based epoxies)
shipping restriction: Only available for shipping within Australia
